title: With the hand tool find walks the matches and wraps, replace is refused, an empty query finds nothing, and the file is untouched
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: saved
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\AAlpha beta alpha BETA\na\.b a\*b a\+b \(x\) \[y\] a\.b\nfoo foofoo food\npath\\to\\file \$1 \^start end\$\nalpha\n\z

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
find alpha
wait 300
mark hand-found
wait 400
find replace-all Z
wait 400
mark hand-refused
wait 400
find next
find next
find next
wait 300
mark wrapped-to-first
wait 400
find previous
wait 300
mark wrapped-to-last
wait 400
find close
find
wait 300
mark empty-query
wait 400
find replace-all X
find next
find previous
find zzzz-not-there
wait 300
mark no-match
wait 400
find next
find replace X
find close
wait 300
quit
